      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 17964,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Solved Exam Numericals (8 KB and 2 KB Ranges)",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sub-mu42d03x-38"
    },
    {
      "id": "sub-mu42d03x-36-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1143,
      "y": 2527,
      "width": 306,
      "height": 114,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu42d041_3"
      ],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 190220,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 136382,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Given starting address S in hexadecimal\nand memory capacity C in bytes, the\nending address is E = S + C - 1. The\nminus-one term is mandatory because the\nstarting address byte is itself the\nfirst addressable location.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "sub-mu42d03x-38-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1195,
      "y": 2698,
      "width": 291,
      "height": 114,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu42d041_3"
      ],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 281649,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 175269,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Problem 1: An 8 KB memory (capacity\n2000H) starting at 2000H spans from\n2000H to (2000H + 2000H - 1) = 3FFFH.\nProblem 2: A 2 KB memory (capacity\n0800H) starting at 8000H spans from\n8000H to (8000H + 0800H - 1) = 87FFH.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "sub-mu42d03x-40",
